  <title>Preferences</title>
  <p>Choose <gui>Preferences</gui> in the main menu (<keyseq><key>Ctrl</key><key>,</key></keyseq>). Changes are saved as you make them.</p>
  <terms>
    <item><title><gui>General</gui></title><p>Whether the guide opens at the start, whether to preview as soon as the scanner is ready, whether to export after each scan and open the picture, a sound when a scan is finished, the colour of dust marks, and a button to restore the defaults.</p></item>
    <item><title><gui>Scanning</gui></title><p>The preview and scan resolutions, infrared, samples and multi-exposure, and how far out of line the infrared and separate scans may be put right, in pixels.</p></item>
    <item><title><gui>Output</gui></title><p>The format, file name, folder, colour space and what to embed.</p></item>
    <item><title><gui>Colour</gui></title><p>The scanner profile new rolls start with.</p></item>
    <item><title><gui>Film Profiles</gui></title><p>Your own film profiles, and importing, exporting, deleting and creating them.</p></item>
  </terms>
</page>
